        <mxCell id="c46" value="&lt;b&gt;1 Table name.&lt;/b&gt; The table stores one type of entity: customers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2 Column.&lt;/b&gt; One attribute recorded for every customer, here CustomerSegment.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3 Row.&lt;/b&gt; One customer and all of its attributes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4 Primary key.&lt;/b&gt; CustomerID uniquely identifies each row.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5 Cell value.&lt;/b&gt; The value of one attribute for one customer: the Region of customer 12." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="254" width="720" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
